# meta::summary1 = (human1) Matthew Goode is an English actor known for his roles in the romantic comedy Chasing Liberty (2004) and Burning Man (2011), as well as television roles including in the series Downton Abbey and The Good Wife.
# meta::summary2 = (claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022) Matthew Goode is an English actor who rose to fame with 2004's Chasing Liberty and went on to star in numerous films and TV shows, including Watchmen, Downton Abbey, The Crown, and A Discovery of Witches.
# meta::summary3 = (gpt4o; postedited) Matthew Goode, born in 1978, is an English actor known for films like Chasing Liberty, Brideshead Revisited, and The Imitation Game, plus TV series Downton Abbey and The Crown, who was educated at Exeter School, the University of Birmingham, and the Webber Douglas Academy of Dramatic Art, and is married to Sophie Dymoke, with whom he has has three children.
# meta::summary4 = (Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct) Matthew Goode is an English character actor born in 1978, known for his roles in films like Chasing Liberty, Match Point, and Watchmen, as well as television shows like Downton Abbey and The Good Wife.
