# meta::summary1 = (human1) Kevin and two other friends discuss a recent emergency room visit for Jito, one of the friends' baby, as well as the dangerous effects of a high fever, some relatives they identify on a picture, and how baby Jito resembles his grandfather when he watches TV half asleep with a bottle in his hand.
# meta::summary2 = (claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022; postedited) During an emergency room visit, a young boy named Jito was admitted with a dangerous fever of 104.5 degrees, leading to a discussion about fever's role in fighting infections and concerns about potential brain damage, while later conversation shifts to his and other children's developmental progress.
# meta::summary3 = (gpt4o) During a conversation, individuals discuss a child's visit to the emergency room due to a high fever, debating the safety and benefits of fevers in babies, while also reflecting on various ways children communicate and share anecdotes about the child's daily habits and interactions.
# meta::summary4 = (Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct; postedited) A mother is discussing her infant son's high fever and possible brain damage with Kevin, and contemplates the risks and the benefits of fever in fighting off the infection.
# meta::summary5 = (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct) A parent discusses their child's high fever, including concerns about potential brain damage, and describes the child's behavior and appearance during the illness, as well as interactions with family members and friends.
# meta::title = Judgmental on People
