# meta::summary1 = (human1) Some veterinarians discuss various treatments and their pricing for several patients while going about daily business in the office, culminating in one vet, Marcia, calling Carol, the owner of a patient, to discuss further treatment of an animal with a broken leg.
# meta::summary2 = (claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022) A veterinarian discusses treatment options and costs for a dog with a spiral tibia fracture, recommending a cast over surgery while coordinating with the owner and staff about the case details.
# meta::summary3 = (gpt4o) A veterinary staff discusses treatment options, including casting and costs, for a dog with a stable spiral fracture in its tibia, estimates the total expenses, and plans to communicate with the dog's owner about the least expensive method that could allow the dog to go home soon, while also handling another procedure involving cat castration.
# meta::summary4 = (Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct; postedited) Marcia and Lindsey discuss the medical treatment of a dog with a distemper vaccine and a dog with a tibial fracture, and they agree on the least expensive alternative for the dog's treatment.
# meta::summary5 = (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct) A veterinarian discusses a dog's treatment plan, including x-rays, potential surgeries, costs, and discharge options, while also handling phone calls and other tasks at the animal clinic.
# meta::title = Vet Morning
