# meta::summary3 = (gpt4o) A teenage boy, Robert, struggles to manage his developmentally delayed sister, Cara, during a mall outing with their mom, which leads to an emotional breakdown and an eventual trip to the emergency room for Cara's worsening asthma, while Robert prepares to spend the evening alone and invites friends over, reflecting on family dynamics and expectations.
