# meta::summary2 = (claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022) Wikinews interviews William Evans, president of the International Brotherhood of Magicians, about magic's current relevance as entertainment, the impact of the internet on the craft, and his extensive travels as president during National Magic Month.
# meta::summary3 = (gpt4o) Wikinews interviews William Evans, president of the International Brotherhood of Magicians, during National Magic Month about his extensive experience of over 50 years in magic, the vibrant status of magic as a form of entertainment today, the double-edged impact of the internet on magic, and his active travel schedule promoting the art worldwide.
