# meta::summary1 = (human1) Jasmine tells about how she tested positive for Covid on December 16th after she spent time with her sister, who did not wear a mask and also tested positive, and recounts her symptoms over several days, starting from a sore throat, then fever and congestion, and finally a partial loss of smell and taste and shortness of breath.
# meta::summary2 = (claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022) A nurse named Jasmine shares her detailed Covid-19 experience after testing positive in December, describing her progression of symptoms from sore throat to fever, heightened senses, and ultimately losing 70% of her taste and smell capabilities.
# meta::summary3 = (gpt4o) A vlogger named Jasmine shares her personal experience with COVID-19, discussing her timeline of symptoms from initial sore throat and fever to changes in taste and smell, and describes how she tested positive after exposure from her sister, using the opportunity to provide support and make others feel less alone during their own experiences with the virus.
# meta::summary4 = (Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct) Jasmine, a nurse, shares her experience of getting Covid-19, from the onset of symptoms like a sore throat to the progression of symptoms like fever, chills, and changes in taste and smell, and how it affected her daily life.
