# meta::summary2 = (claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022; postedited) During a spring cleaning session, the speaker shares her experience sorting through her lipstick collection, showing how she checks expiration dates and makes decisions about which products to keep or discard based on their shelf life symbols and age.
# meta::summary3 = (gpt4o; postedited) A woman vlogs her spring cleaning of an extensive lipstick collection, discussing expiration dates, sorting expired ones for disposal, and sharing moments with her pet, and also considers storage solutions and shares her surprise about expiration symbols on cosmetics.
# meta::summary4 = (Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct; postedited) The speaker is spring cleaning her makeup collection and sorting out expired lipsticks, including some that are over two years old, and discussing the shelf life of various lipsticks and why it's hard to tell if they're still good.
