# meta::sourceURL = https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HorCZXed1gI
# meta::speakerCount = 4
# meta::summary1 = (human1) In this vlog entry Jackie puts on a Grecian-style mermaid outfit that her friend Marianne made and has Marianne take photos of her, after which they go to Harry Potter World in Orlando together with a man who is probably Jackie's boyfriend, and they all enjoy and review the rides and food there.
# meta::summary2 = (claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022) A vlogger named Jackie documents a trip to Florida where she does a Grecian-themed mermaid photoshoot at Alexander Springs until a potential alligator sighting interrupts them, followed by a visit to Universal Studios' Harry Potter World with her friend Marianne.
# meta::summary3 = (gpt4o; postedited) Vlogger Jackie visits Alexander Springs for a Grecian mermaid photo shoot with friend Marianne, before heading to Harry Potter World in Orlando, where they explore Hogsmeade, buy interactive wands, and ride Harry Potter and the Forbidden Journey, concluding the day with lunch at the Leaky Cauldron, despite minor hiccups.
# meta::summary4 = (Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct; postedited) Jackie and her friend Marianne are on a road trip to Alexander Springs and then to Orlando, where they plan to visit Harry Potter World, starting with a mermaid photo shoot, a brief stop at a quirky store on the way and then a fun experience trying out interactive wands and riding the Harry Potter and the Forbidden Journey ride.
# meta::summary5 = (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct) Jackie and her friends embark on a mermaid photo shoot at Alexander Springs and later visit Universal Studios' Harry Potter World in Orlando, enjoying various attractions and activities along the way.
# meta::title = WIZARDING WORLD OF HARRY POTTER 2022🧙🏼‍♀️ universal studios vlog + florida week in my life🐊
