# meta::summary2 = (claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022) A woman shares her early pregnancy journey at 7 weeks, describing her initial anxiety and shock upon finding out, current symptoms like loss of appetite and headaches, and her decision to document the experience while expecting a baby in mid-September.
