# newdoc id = GUM_vlog_wine
# global.Entity = GRP-etype-infstat-salience-centering-minspan-link-identity
# meta::author = Finn Thormeier
# meta::dateCollected = 2023-01-04
# meta::dateCreated = 2018-10-16
# meta::dateModified = 2018-10-16
# meta::genre = vlog
# meta::salientEntities = 3 (5*), 13 (4*), 16 (4*), 53 (4*), 54 (4*), 118 (4*), 20 (3*), 21 (3), 83 (3), 100 (3*), 115 (3*), 116 (3*), 138 (3*), 32 (2), 42 (2), 43 (2), 79 (2), 90 (2), 128 (2*), 130 (2*), 7 (1), 9 (1), 10 (1), 12 (1), 44 (1), 67 (1), 73 (1), 96 (1), 139 (1*), 149 (1)
# meta::sourceURL = https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tmZ9Vb1jIW4
# meta::speakerCount = 4
# meta::summary1 = (human1) After leaving their home near a beautiful lagoon in South Africa, three friends drive to a wine tasting at a winery, where a sommelier explains about South African wines and serves a cheese platter, with the favorite wines being the white Signature Sauvignon Blanc from Spier and the Creative Block 3, as well as the red Creative Block 5.
# meta::summary2 = (claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022; postedited) In South Africa, the speakers visit a winery for a detailed tasting of various wines including Sauvignon Blanc, Chardonnay-Pinot Noir blend, Pinotage (a unique South African grape), Shiraz, and Cabernet, along with a cheese platter, where they learn about aging periods and each person's favorite wines.
# meta::summary3 = (gpt4o; postedited) A tourist in South Africa enjoyed lagoon waters, Bremen coffee, and a wine tasting featuring Sauvignon Blanc, Pinotage, and a favorite, Creative Block blend, an experience enhanced by a cheese platter and a shared preference for affordable wines over pricier options.
# meta::summary4 = (Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct) A South African wine enthusiast visits a winery and shares his wine tasting experience with others, discussing various wine types, their characteristics, and his favorites.
# meta::summary5 = (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct) A group goes on a wine tasting tour in South Africa, sampling various wines including Sauvignon Blanc, Chardonnay-Pinot Noir blend, Chardonnay, Pinotage, Shiraz, and Cabernet Sauvignon blends, discussing their flavors and aging potential.
# meta::title = WINE TASTING IN STELLENBOSCH, SOUTH AFRICA | CAPE TOWN VLOG
# newpar
# newpar_block = sp who:::"#FinnThormeier" (10 s)
# sent_id = GUM_vlog_wine-1
# s_type = intj
# s_prominence = 3
# transition = establishment
