# meta::dateCollected = 2015-09-21
# meta::dateCreated = 2011-06-11
# meta::dateModified = 2015-07-28
# meta::genre = whow
# meta::salientEntities = 1 (5*), 2 (5*), 18 (5*), 3 (4), 45 (4*), 5 (3*), 21 (3*), 36 (3*), 95 (3*), 16 (2), 23 (2*), 27 (2*), 29 (2*), 52 (2), 4 (1*), 10 (1), 17 (1), 19 (1), 20 (1*), 41 (1*), 42 (1*), 63 (1*), 87 (1), 102 (1)
# meta::sourceURL = https://www.wikihow.com/Cope-With-a-Double-Parachute-Failure
# meta::speakerCount = 0
# meta::summary1 = (human1) This double parachute failure guide advises remaining calm, alerting fellow jumpers by waving your arms and linking arms with them through their harness, prepare for chute deployment shock and impact and steering away from power lines and towards water (or in a solo jump, attempting to open the reserve chute or else praying).
# meta::summary2 = (claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022) This guide on surviving double parachute failure while skydiving outlines strategies including staying calm, seeking help from fellow jumpers, hooking onto their harness, dealing with impact, and if alone, attempting last-ditch efforts or accepting fate with philosophical resignation.
# meta::summary3 = (gpt4o) This guide on coping with a double parachute failure while skydiving emphasizes staying calm, seeking help from nearby jumpers if possible, and otherwise attempting psychological coping strategies or making peace with the situation, acknowledging that survival is highly unlikely without at least one functioning parachute.
# meta::summary4 = (Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct) When experiencing a double parachute failure during skydiving, prioritizing staying calm and either deploying a fellow jumper's parachute (if available) or using the reserve parachute yourself increases your chances of survival.
# meta::summary5 = (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct) In the highly improbable scenario of a double parachute failure while skydiving, remain calm, seek assistance from nearby jumpers, deploy your backup parachute, prepare for the intense shock of deployment, and if alone, attempt to open either parachute or consider the inevitability of impact as the most probable outcome.
# meta::title = How to Cope With a Double Parachute Failure
# newpar
# newpar_block = head rend:::"bold" (1 s)
