# meta::sourceURL = https://www.wikihow.com/Make-Skittles-Vodka
# meta::speakerCount = 0
# meta::summary1 = (human1) This guide gives three methods of making Skittles flavored vodka, by choosing desired Skittles flavors and colors (often without lime green and grape purple) and dissolving them in vodka shots followed by filtering, or by making an entire bottle the same way over two days, or more quickly by placing bottles in a running dishwasher and shaking them.
# meta::summary2 = (claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022) This article provides three methods for infusing vodka with Skittles candy - a single serving shot method, a bottle infusion method, and a dishwasher method - each involving separating Skittles by color, dissolving them in vodka, filtering out solids, and chilling the flavored result.
# meta::summary3 = (gpt4o; postedited) This guide describes making Skittles vodka using three methods: single shots, bottles, and a dishwasher method, involving dissolving Skittles in vodka, straining out residue, and experimenting with ratios for flavor customization, with tips given for quicker preparation, using filters and funnels, while emphasizing responsible drinking.
# meta::summary4 = (Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct) This article provides three methods for making Skittles vodka: a single serving method, a bottle method, and a dishwasher bottle method, each with its own set of instructions and tips for creating a flavored and colorful vodka.
# meta::summary5 = (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct) Making Skittles Vodka involves infusing vodka with crushed Skittles of desired colors for varying lengths of time, filtering out the candy pieces, and optionally using different methods such as shaking in a dishwasher or letting the mixture sit in the fridge.
